    "k401": "[80] Zonghang Li et al., “Prima.cpp: Fast 30-70B LLM Inference on Heterogeneous and Low-Resource Home Clusters,” arXiv:2504.08791, apr 2025 — <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2504.08791\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">arxiv.org</a>",
    "k402": "[81] Cloud Security Alliance, “MCP Security Crisis: Systemic Design Flaws in AI Agent Infrastructure,” mei 2026 — <a href=\"https://labs.cloudsecurityalliance.org/research/csa-research-note-mcp-security-crisis-20260504-csa-styled/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">labs.cloudsecurityalliance.org</a>",
    "k403": "[82] IETF, RFC 6762 “Multicast DNS” &amp; RFC 6763 “DNS-Based Service Discovery,” feb 2013 — de zero-configuration discovery die in miljarden apparaten draait — <a href=\"https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc6762\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">datatracker.ietf.org</a>",
    "k404": "[83] Open Container Initiative, “OCI Distribution Specification” — content-addressed, registry-gebaseerde artefactdistributie; het patroon dat Ollama gebruikt om modellen te verspreiden — <a href=\"https://github.com/opencontainers/distribution-spec\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">github.com</a>",
    "k405": "[84] Hugging Face Hub documentation, “GGUF” — het single-file gequantiseerde modelformaat dat lokale runtimes gebruiken — <a href=\"https://huggingface.co/docs/hub/gguf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">huggingface.co</a>",
    "k406": "[85] Alexander Borzunov et al., “Petals: Collaborative Inference and Fine-tuning of Large Models,” arXiv:2209.01188, 2023 — <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2209.01188\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">arxiv.org</a>",
    "k407": "[86] Open Home Foundation — de stichting zonder winstoogmerk achter Home Assistant, opgericht in april 2024 — <a href=\"https://www.openhomefoundation.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">openhomefoundation.org</a>",
    "k436": "Solliciteer voor een oprichtersplek",
    "k437": "Geen kosten — we selecteren op wat je kunt bijdragen. Neem de tijd: een antwoord kan weken duren, soms maanden — maar iedereen krijgt er een.",
